INTERACTION REQUIREMENTS
Ensure all page connections are complete:
- nav items lead to real pages
- category cards link correctly
- product cards link to product detail pages
- seller cards link to seller profiles
- seller login leads to seller dashboard
- buyer login leads to buyer account
- CTAs are wired logically
- breadcrumbs work
- footer links connect
No dead ends. No placeholder disconnected screens.

VISUAL STYLE DETAILS
- Minimal but not cold
- Premium but still commercial
- Spacious layouts
- Big white areas
- Strong typography hierarchy
- Orange CTA moments only where needed
- Light blue softly used behind product imagery or in cards
- Navy should anchor the system, especially header/nav and selected structural elements
- Product cards should feel elevated and curated, not mass-market
- Editorial sections should feel like a concept store magazine
- Dashboard UI should still feel consistent with the storefront brand

DO NOT DO
- no black heavy luxury aesthetic
- no beige or cream background
- no overcrowded ecommerce layouts
- no random gradients
- no generic startup SaaS visuals
- no dark homepage
- no low-contrast unreadable UI
- no broken or disconnected flows
- no missing states
- no unstyled backend-looking dashboard

